msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/performance/06-output-variables.ipynb:376
msgid ""
"That is, the solve time is the same, but the memory usage has been reduced "
"by an order of magnitude."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/performance/06-output-variables.ipynb:379
